  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "comment": "Strains of D. dadantii 3937 were cultivated at 30 °C in nutrient broth (NB) (Difco), King's B medium (King et al., 1954) or minimal medium A (MMA) (per litre: K2HPO4, 7 g; KH2PO4, 3 g; Mg2SO4.7H2O, 0.1 g; (NH4)2SO4, 1 g; citric acid, 0.5 g; 0.2 % glycerol)."
